---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Site Map
description: Browse Cert Happens practice tests, study guides, references, tools, Explore articles, and site information.
permalink: /sitemap/
dateCreated: "2026-08-05"
datePublished: "2026-08-05"
dateModified: "2026-08-05"
stylesheets:
  - /assets/css/site-map.css?v=20260805-1
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Home
    url: /
  - label: Site Map
    url: /sitemap/
---
<header class="page-header page-header--compact">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-current="page">Site Map</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Find a page</p>
    <h1>Site Map</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Browse practice tests, study guides, references, tools, career guidance, and site information.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="page-shell site-map" aria-label="Site pages">
    {% for section in collections.humanSitemapSections %}
    <section class="site-map__section" aria-labelledby="site-map-{{ section.id }}">
      <h2 id="site-map-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.label }}</h2>
      <ul class="site-map__links">
        {% for item in section.pages %}
        <li><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.label }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
